 NoOrYesWithoutStatusbar;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ "No-or-Yes" dialog without a status bar
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForNoOrYes
 parms.(hasProgressbar hasStatusbar)←2⍴0
 ⎕←myGuiParms parms ##.GUI.Dialogs.NoOrYes'Are you really sure about this?'
